# Voice agents

## Active channels
Plivo CX (voice), Plivo WhatsApp, Vapi (legacy).

## Eligibility
`usp_GetEligibleCandidatesForPlivoCXCalls` / `Reschedule` — see `Docs/VoiceAgents.md`.

## Code paths
- Services: `PlivoCXService`, `PlivoWhatsAppService`, `VapiService`
- Repos: `PlivoCXCallRepository`, etc.
- Jobs: `Risebird.AzureTimerFunctions/PlivoCX*.cs`

## Agent prompts
Text files at repo root: `Plivo_*_Agent_Instructions.txt`

## Webhooks
Hangup callbacks update logs, disposition on `Candidate.PlivoCXDisposition`, booking via Schedule API.
